  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Ghost_Villager/BH_Ghost_Villager_header.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"450\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本模组添加了<strong>幽灵村民</strong>，这是一种稀有的游荡灵魂，会在日落后在村庄中生成。与普通村民不同，它只在夜间存在，太阳升起时便会消失。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Ghost_Villager/BH_Ghost_Villager_description.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">幽灵村民是一种稀有的交易商，会在夜间出现在村庄并在日出时消失。它具有五级进阶系统，随着等级提升，可解锁越来越强大的交易物品，从有用的资源如烈焰棒、末影珍珠到高级附魔、不死图腾、潜影盒、鞘翅，甚至是下界之星。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">由于它的进度每天早上都会重置，你需要准备充足的绿宝石，并充分利用黎明前的有限时间。请在夜幕降临后留意村庄，你永远不知道幽灵村民何时会出现。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Ghost_Villager/BH_Ghost_Villager_screenshots.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1715/391/1-ghost-villager-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1715/393/2-ghost-villager-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1715/397/6-ghost-villager-jpg.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\"></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X4BEeSByGU\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Ghost_Villager/BH_Ghost_Villager_discord.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></a></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>准备好与朋友在最佳主机上畅玩了吗？</strong></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fflashh\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Ghost_Villager/BH_Ghost_Villager_promo2.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"250\"></strong></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">我推荐<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fFlashh\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Bisect Hosting</strong></a>，因为它的服务器高质量且无延迟，适合与朋友一起游玩。你可以安装任何 CurseForge 模组包或自定义模组而不会出现错误。此外，他们的支持团队全天候 24/7 随时待命，帮助您解决任何问题。使用我的代码 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fFlashh\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>可享受购买 25% 的折扣</strong></a>。</span></p>",
